<p>Your glyphs are imbued with celestial fury; they last <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns longer and when triggered they will deal damage.</p><p><span style="color: #FFD700"><span class="tstr-color-FFD700">Glyph of Sunlight</span></span>:  Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> light damage.</p><p><span style="color: #7F7F7F"><span class="tstr-color-7F7F7F">Glyph of Moonlight</span></span>:  Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> darkness damage.</p><p><span style="color: #9D9DC9"><span class="tstr-color-9D9DC9">Glyph of Twilight</span></span>:  Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 40, 47, 54, 60</acronym> light and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 40, 47, 54, 60</acronym> darkness damage.</p>